        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift\n- Products: Red, State of Grace\n- Events: The Red Tour\n- Places: Omaha, Nebraska, Singapore\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift released her fourth studio album, Red, in 2012.\n- Taylor Swift's song \"State of Grace\" is from her 2012 album Red.\n- The Red Tour was Taylor Swift's third concert tour and was launched in support of her fourth studio album, Red.\n- The Red Tour began on March 13, 2013, in Omaha, Nebraska.\n- Taylor Swift completed The Red Tour on June 12, 2014, in Singapore.\n- The Red Tour grossed over $150 million and became the highest-grossing tour of all time by a country artist.",
